Detach the Camera from an Object
If you do not need the camera, which you attached to an object, any longer, you can detach it from the
object.
To detach the camera, click 
  Detach Camera on the View ribbon tab of the 3D window. Plant
Simulation then returns to normal view.
Plant Simulation also detaches an object camera:
• When you delete the object to which the camera is attached.
• When you change the scene.
